On Monday 19 April 2010 01:37:24 MorphemeAddict wrote:
> And it should be "najynimre", eh?

"cn" and "jm" and "cm" are valid initial pairs, but "jn" is not. So "jnimre" 
is not a lujvo, so you don't have to add "y" to "najnimre" to avoid a 
tosmabru. "cr" but not "jr" is also a valid initial.

